message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Rank stability of two-dimensional transistor channel screening under first-principles uncertainty: analysis code and derived data"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data for a screening-scale test of whether the ordering of
  candidate two-dimensional transistor channel materials survives documented
  first-principles uncertainty. Calibrated band-gap, effective-mass and
  permittivity uncertainty are propagated through a ballistic ambipolar
  double-gate device model for 754 monolayers, and assessed with pairwise
  dominance probabilities, Kendall's tau, rank entropy and Sobol indices.
